        <!-- Version 2.2.0 - Previous Release -->
        <item>
            <title>Daily Task Manager 2.2.0 - Enhanced Settings Page</title>
            <sparkle:version>2.2.0.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Daily Task Manager 2.2.0 - Enhanced Settings Page</h3>
                <p><strong>Major Settings Page Enhancements:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Individual Export Paths:</strong> Separate export paths for PDF, Word, and Excel files</li>
                    <li><strong>Enhanced Application Settings:</strong> Complete database connection details display</li>
                    <li><strong>Streamlined Interface:</strong> Removed unnecessary Add/Save buttons from Database Settings</li>
                    <li><strong>Native Folder Picker:</strong> Modern Browse button functionality for all export paths</li>
                    <li><strong>Improved Settings Persistence:</strong> Better fallback logic (Database → appsettings.json → Desktop default)</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Bug Fixes:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed DatePicker binding issue for task editing</li>
                    <li>Resolved filtering date range issues</li>
                    <li>Enhanced Excel export file styling</li>
                </ul>
                <p>This update provides better control over export functionality and improved user experience with comprehensive settings management.</p>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/MuhamedAlNaqli/DailyTaskManager/releases/download/v2.2.0/DailyTaskManager-v2.2.0-win-x64.zip</link>
