        <!-- Version 2.1.0 - Previous Release -->
        <item>
            <title>Daily Task Manager 2.1.0</title>
            <sparkle:version>2.1.0.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>Daily Task Manager 2.1.0</h3>
                <p><strong>Major Features:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Complete migration from WPF to Avalonia UI for cross-platform support</li>
                    <li>Added Google OAuth2 authentication</li>
                    <li>Implemented speech recognition functionality</li>
                    <li>Modern Material Design interface</li>
                    <li>Enhanced export functionality (Excel, PDF)</li>
                    <li>Auto-update system with NetSparkleUpdater</li>
                </ul>
                <p><strong>Improvements:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Cross-platform compatibility (Windows, macOS, Linux)</li>
                    <li>Improved performance and reliability</li>
                    <li>Professional MSI installer with automated versioning</li>
                    <li>Enhanced database schema and migration system</li>
                    <li>Better error handling and logging</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
